{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763850/extras/075af5d24ec177e638adf022b68aad78.poster.avif?t=1771617709\" width=1170 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763850/extras/075af5d24ec177e638adf022b68aad78.webm?t=1771617709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763850/extras/075af5d24ec177e638adf022b68aad78.mp4?t=1771617709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Par Party</strong>\u00a0is a no holds parred platforming party golf game where you and your friends build courses with traps, powerups, and more!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level editor!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your imagination go wild and draw the golf course of your dreams in Par Party's unique level editor! Share it with your friends, your enemies, or the whole world on the <strong>Steam Workshop</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Up to 8 Player online multiplayer!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At last you can prove you are the best, par none.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1-4 Player Split-Screen!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The early 2000's called, it wants its gamemode back. Grab a few controllers and a few friends and divide up your screen. It's called Par PARTY for a reason!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerups!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap on a jetpack, turn your friends into cubes, become a football, and so much more!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Game Modes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your hand at drawing a level within the time limit and challenge your friends to beat it. Or just play the community levels with custom game settings!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make yourself un-fore-gettable with an in-depth customization system</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Final note:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I promise there aren't this many puns in the actual game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2763850?t=1771617709","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2763850?t=1771617709","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763850/db0e1545ae096b0e3ada3b5853f42fb1922c4181/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771617709","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763850/db0e1545ae096b0e3ada3b5853f42fb1922c4181/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771617709","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763850/extras/075af5d24ec177e638adf022b68aad78.poster.avif?t=1771617709\" width=1170 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763850/extras/075af5d24ec177e638adf022b68aad78.webm?t=1771617709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763850/extras/075af5d24ec177e638adf022b68aad78.mp4?t=1771617709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Par Party</strong>\u00a0is a no holds parred platforming party golf game where you and your friends build courses with traps, powerups, and more!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level editor!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your imagination go wild and draw the golf course of your dreams in Par Party's unique level editor! Share it with your friends, your enemies, or the whole world on the <strong>Steam Workshop</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Up to 8 Player online multiplayer!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At last you can prove you are the best, par none.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1-4 Player Split-Screen!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The early 2000's called, it wants its gamemode back. Grab a few controllers and a few friends and divide up your screen. It's called Par PARTY for a reason!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerups!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap on a jetpack, turn your friends into cubes, become a football, and so much more!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Game Modes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your hand at drawing a level within the time limit and challenge your friends to beat it. Or just play the community levels with custom game settings!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make yourself un-fore-gettable with an in-depth customization system</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Final note:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I promise there aren't this many puns in the actual game.</p>","developers":["Chronic Vagrant"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763850/2c13db3da7f4776a789ec5d5a9655a47a3ef5caa/header.jpg?t=1771617709","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</stron